@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF

participant ":MainWindow" as Window UI_COLOR
participant ":Logic" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":PersonListPanel" as List UI_COLOR
participant ":DetailPane" as Detail UI_COLOR

[-> Window : executeCommand("view 1")
activate Window
Window -> Logic : execute("view 1")
activate Logic
note over Logic
Parse input and validate the displayed index.
Return feedback and a view index.
No client data is changed or saved.
end note
Logic --> Window : result:CommandResult
deactivate Logic
Window -> List : selectPerson(index)
activate List
List -> List : Select the displayed client
List -> Window : selectedPersonProperty listener(...)
activate Window
Window -> Detail : setPerson(newPerson)
activate Detail
Detail --> Window
deactivate Detail
Window --> List
deactivate Window
List -> List : Scroll to the selected index
List --> Window
deactivate List
note over Window
Display result feedback (omitted).
end note
[<-- Window : result
deactivate Window
@enduml
